			zh: "面向 YouTube 与 Bilibili 的个性化音视频 AI 助手，提供双语字幕、AI 视频总结和视频问答，帮你快速抓住重点。",
			en: "A personalized audio and video AI assistant for YouTube and Bilibili with bilingual subtitles, AI summaries, and video Q&A.",
		},
		tags: ["个人"],
	},
	{
		url: "https://cocotranslate.com/",
		icon: "/projects/cocotranslate.png",
		tone: "green",
		name: {
			zh: "椰子翻译",
			en: "Coco Translate",
		},
		description: {
			zh: "免费的 AI 沉浸式翻译浏览器插件，支持 PDF 文档翻译、网页双语、划词翻译与视频字幕，多快好省的跨语言阅读体验。",
			en: "A free AI immersive translation browser extension for PDFs, bilingual web pages, selected text, and video subtitles.",
		},
		tags: ["公司"],
	},
	{
		url: "https://easykol.com/",
		icon: "/projects/easykol.png",
		tone: "blue",
		name: {
			zh: "Easykol",
			en: "Easykol",
		},
		description: {
			zh: "最好用的海外营销工具，帮你快速找到红人并内置邮件模板和批量建联，覆盖 TikTok、Instagram、YouTube、小红书、抖音等主流平台。",
			en: "An overseas marketing tool for discovering creators and managing outreach across TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Xiaohongshu, and Douyin.",
		},
		tags: ["公司"],
	},
	{
		url: "https://neovateai.dev/",
		icon: "/projects/neovateCode-76.webp",
		iconWidth: 76,
		iconHeight: 78,
		tone: "violet",
